Description: Remove wacom support
 Temporary patch to resolve GNOME 49 changes that causes the desktop
 to crash.
 Upstream are looking at this and in a future update hopefully
 a fix can be made.
Author: David Mohammed <fossfreedom@ubuntu.com>
Origin: other
Bug: https://github.com/BuddiesOfBudgie/budgie-desktop/pull/739
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-08-22

